      en: ["First designated as a protected area in 1937.", "Located in close proximity to the town of Boromo.", "Integrated into the Parc National des Deux Balés.", "Home to one of the northernmost elephant herds in Africa.", "Borders the Mouhoun (Black Volta) River.", "Acts as a vital corridor for migratory wildlife species."],
