      en: ["The third-longest river in Africa at 4,180 km.", "Forms a portion of the border between Burkina Faso and Niger.", "Its drainage basin covers a vast part of West Africa.", "Historically vital to the Mali and Songhai Empires.", "Essential for regional transport, fishing, and hydropower.", "Recognized as a key transboundary water resource."],
      es: ["Longitud: 4.180 km", "Tercer río más largo de África", "Fuente: Tierras altas de Guinea", "Desembocadura: Golfo de Guinea", "Cuenca hidrográfica: 2,1 millones de km²", "Países ribereños: Guinea, Malí, Níger, Benín, Nigeria"],
