      en: ["Officially designated as a Forêt classée (classified forest).", "Protects the unique biodiversity of the Sudanese savannah.", "Serves as a crucial natural barrier against desertification.", "Source of non-timber forest products like medicinal plants.", "Managed through collaborative community-based initiatives.", "Threatened by illegal charcoal production and fire clearing."],
