      en: ["Covers approximately 32,700 hectares in southern Burkina Faso.", "Officially classified as a protected forest in 1953.", "Key corridor for elephant migration between Burkina and Ghana.", "Dominated by baobabs and shea (karité) trees.", "Integral part of the Nazinga-Mole ecological landscape.", "Major source of raw materials for the shea butter industry."],
